Dynatrace Agent Skills

The contents of `skills/` in this plugin are an unmodified copy of the
`skills/` directory of Dynatrace's official "Dynatrace for AI" plugin:

  Repository: https://github.com/Dynatrace/dynatrace-for-ai
  Path:       skills/
  Commit:     4f9aa71f9802aa6db0a4069ae5619eb3392ff411 (plugin version 8.0.1)

