Everything else in this plugin (`.devin-plugin/plugin.json`, which declares
the hosted Dynatrace MCP server and its credentials) is maintained in this
repository and is not part of the upstream copy.

To update the skills, replace `skills/` with the `skills/` directory of a
newer upstream commit and update the commit above.
